# Default-deny: ~/.claude holds credentials, transcripts, and caches.
# Only explicitly whitelisted config is version controlled.
*

!.gitignore
!CLAUDE.md
!keybindings.json
!settings_personal.json
!settings_format.py
!settings_merge.py
!statusline-command.sh

# Directories need both the dir and its contents un-ignored.
!agents/
!agents/**
!commands/
!commands/**
!hooks/
!hooks/**
!output-styles/
!output-styles/**
!skills/
!skills/**
